    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at a ticket for a shattered ceramic vase. Customer is demanding a full refund. Quick question: Based on the carrier sensor logs and what the customer is saying, what's the move here to keep our CSAT high without letting unnecessary refund costs eat into our margins? Give me a recommendation on how to handle it efficiently.",
